At the 1e-4 threshold, mean over the four molecules and four models: clean 72.0, haze3e7 61.2, cloud1e2 64.3, absorbers 71.8, spots10 66.2, spots20 63.5, noise_x2 67.6, noise_x3 64.9

Deviations from Mugnai et al. 2021: forward model MultiREx/TauREx 3 with Exo-Transmit tables (theirs: TauREx 3 with ExoMol k-tables);
noise shape from ExoSim2 rather than ArielRad, level set by the Tier-1 requirement per target; 965 known MCS planets (2026 list)
rather than their 1000 (2019 list incl. TESS predictions); training spectra noised once, not resampled per epoch.
